'''Seasons of Love''' (恋の季節, ''Koi no Kisetsu'', '''Season of Love''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

